{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>重陽節長周末假期，昨日有超過135萬人次經各口岸出入境。</p><p></p><p>入境處數字顯示，星期六有逾67萬人次香港居民出境，內地訪客入境人次就有超過13萬。其中經皇崗口岸出入境共有約13萬人次，當中香港居民有逾6萬人次出境。</p><p></p><p>最多人經羅湖管制站出境，有逾17萬人次；經落馬洲支線管制站出境的有逾13萬人次。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T11:39:21.579884+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":145,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T17:57:46.055789+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:38:01.042678+00:00","content_hash":"8e1a34ceb3d8353a2d3de63baffac0cb740a5c7cc7dd6cd499d02459b1fa4d5f","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}